    <!-- Tutorial -->
    <string name="tw_tut_01">Welcome, commander. Your goal is to conquer the whole map.</string>
    <string name="tw_tut_02">The map is split into territories. Each one holds your armies or an enemy\'s.</string>
    <string name="tw_tut_03">Every turn has three steps: reinforce, attack, then fortify.</string>
    <string name="tw_tut_04">You get armies for territories held, plus a bonus for whole regions.</string>
    <string name="tw_tut_05">Tap one of your territories to place an army there.</string>
    <string name="tw_tut_06">Now attack: pick a territory with 2 or more armies, then a neighbour.</string>
    <string name="tw_tut_07">Dice decide each fight. The highest dice are compared and ties go to the defender.</string>
    <string name="tw_tut_08">If the defender runs out of armies, you take the territory and move in.</string>
    <string name="tw_tut_09">Conquer at least one territory in a turn to earn a card.</string>
    <string name="tw_tut_10">Three matching or three different cards make a set. Turn it in for armies.</string>
    <string name="tw_tut_11">Finish by fortifying: move armies between two connected territories.</string>
    <string name="tw_tut_12">Pinch the map to zoom, or open the territory list to pick one.</string>
    <string name="tw_tut_13">Hold every territory of a region to earn its bonus each turn.</string>
    <string name="tw_tut_14">The last commander standing wins. Good luck!</string>
